  data: {
    LLM: "Once partner is known, direct trick points to your side; play high-value cards (A, 10, K) to partner's tricks (smearing). Lead fail aces early to win 11 points or draw trumps.\n\nIf holding Spade Q, leading a high trump can invite partner to reveal with Club Q. Hold the Diamond 7 (Spitzer) to beat Spade Q when opportune; track which fail suits have been played.\n\nDouble-cutting a led fail ace (trumping then being overtrumped) is a key tactic. After a fail suit has been played twice, leading it again is effectively leading trump. Distribute smear cards early; later in the hand you have less control.",
    Player: "Once partner is known, direct trick points to your side; play high-value cards (A, 10, K) to partner's tricks (smearing). Lead fail aces early to win 11 points or draw trumps.\n\nIf holding Spade Q, leading a high trump can invite partner to reveal with Club Q. Hold the Diamond 7 (Spitzer) to beat Spade Q when opportune; track which fail suits have been played.\n\nDouble-cutting a led fail ace (trumping then being overtrumped) is a key tactic. After a fail suit has been played twice, leading it again is effectively leading trump. Distribute smear cards early; later in the hand you have less control.",
